    "html": "<div class=\"c-hero o-module no-bottom-margin\">\n<div class=\"c-hero__layout-container\">\n<div class=\"c-hero__content\">\n<h1 class=\"c-hero__header\">Our programmes and projects</h1>\n<div class=\"o-border-small\"></div>\n<div class=\"o-flex\">\n<div class=\"c-hero__body\">\n<div class=\"c-hero__body-text\"><p>Sightsavers runs programmes in eye health, neglected tropical diseases and disability rights. Here, you can explore a selection of our current and recent projects. </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-hero__navigation c-hero__navigation--desktop\">\n<button>\n    On this page\n    <svg class=\"c-hero__navigation-icon\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 32 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<g fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" id=\"Page-1\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n<g fill=\"#921750\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\" id=\"#921750ff\" transform=\"translate(0.300000, 0.040000)\">\n<path d=\"M2.84,0.01 C7.09,4.24 11.32,8.49 15.56,12.73 C19.83,8.5 24.06,4.24 28.31,-7.10542736e-15 C29.26,0.94 30.21,1.88 31.15,2.83 C25.98,8.05 20.79,13.24 15.57,18.41 C10.37,13.22 5.17,8.04 0,2.83 C0.94,1.89 1.89,0.95 2.84,0.01 Z\" id=\"Path\"></path>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</button>\n<p>\n    On this page\n  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a class=\"c-hero__navigation-link\" href=\"#current-programmes\">Current programmes</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a class=\"c-hero__navigation-link\" href=\"#recent-programmes\">Recent programmes</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a class=\"c-hero__navigation-link\" href=\"#our-programme-evaluations\">Our programme evaluations</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"c-hero__media-wrapper\">\n<figure class=\"c-hero__media c-hero__media--image\">\n<div class=\"c-hero__media-bottom\">\n</div>\n<figcaption class=\"c-hero__media-caption\">\n<span class=\"c-hero__media-caption-icon\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" role=\"img\" viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M512 144v288c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H48c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V144c0-26.5 21.5-48 48-48h88l12.3-32.9c7-18.7 24.9-31.1 44.9-31.1h125.5c20 0 37.9 12.4 44.9 31.1L376 96h88c26.5 0 48 21.5 48 48zM376 288c0-66.2-53.8-120-120-120s-120 53.8-120 120 53.8 120 120 120 120-53.8 120-120zm-32 0c0 48.5-39.5 88-88 88s-88-39.5-88-88 39.5-88 88-88 88 39.5 88 88z\" fill=\"#373737\"></path></svg> </span>\n<span class=\"c-hero__media-caption-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHealth worker Zita teaches communities in Zambia about the importance of hygiene and preventative medication in eliminating trachoma.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n</figcaption>\n<div class=\"c-hero__media-top\">\n<div alt=\"Zita stands outside talking to community members.\" class=\"c-hero__media-image\" style=\"background-image:url('/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/2506_Sightsavers_Zita-in-community-extended-1-1400x788.jpg')\"></div>\n</div>\n</figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-hero__navigation c-hero__navigation--mobile\">\n<button>\n    On this page\n    <svg class=\"c-hero__navigation-icon\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 32 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<g fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" id=\"Page-1\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n<g fill=\"#921750\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\" id=\"#921750ff\" transform=\"translate(0.300000, 0.040000)\">\n<path d=\"M2.84,0.01 C7.09,4.24 11.32,8.49 15.56,12.73 C19.83,8.5 24.06,4.24 28.31,-7.10542736e-15 C29.26,0.94 30.21,1.88 31.15,2.83 C25.98,8.05 20.79,13.24 15.57,18.41 C10.37,13.22 5.17,8.04 0,2.83 C0.94,1.89 1.89,0.95 2.84,0.01 Z\" id=\"Path\"></path>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</button>\n<p>\n    On this page\n  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a class=\"c-hero__navigation-link\" href=\"#current-programmes\">Current programmes</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a class=\"c-hero__navigation-link\" href=\"#recent-programmes\">Recent programmes</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a class=\"c-hero__navigation-link\" href=\"#our-programme-evaluations\">Our programme evaluations</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>"
