    "html": "<div class=\"c-discover-more-2 o-module no-bottom-margin\">\n<div class=\"o-layout-container\">\n<h2 class=\"c-discover-more-2__title\">Current programmes</h2>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__grid\">\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/focus-on-clear-vision/\" style=\"flex:2\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"Jayden sits at a table reading. He is wearing his glasses.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2511_Sightsavers-jayden-reading-focus-on-clear-vision-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2511_Sightsavers-jayden-reading-focus-on-clear-vision-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2511_Sightsavers-jayden-reading-focus-on-clear-vision-300x169.jpg 1x\">\n</img></div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Focus on Clear Vision</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">Sightsavers is providing free vision tests, eye health checks and pairs of glasses in Nigeria and Kenya, as part of Bloomberg Philanthropies’ Vision Initiative.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/reaching-the-last-mile-fund/\" style=\"flex:2\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A woman drinks from a cup after taking medication. A female community volunteer sits next to her holding a pill bottle.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2511_Sightsavers-anita-with-evarly-MDA-liberia-RLM-219761-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2511_Sightsavers-anita-with-evarly-MDA-liberia-RLM-219761-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2511_Sightsavers-anita-with-evarly-MDA-liberia-RLM-219761-300x169.jpg 1x\">\n</img></div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Reaching the Last Mile Fund</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">Sightsavers is working with partners across Africa to support countries to eliminate onchocerciasis and lymphatic filariasis.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__grid\">\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/accelerate/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"Eye care staff perform trachoma surveys on children in Cote D'Ivoire.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/2003_Sightsavers-accelerate-trachoma-survey-cote-divoire-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/2003_Sightsavers-accelerate-trachoma-survey-cote-divoire-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/2003_Sightsavers-accelerate-trachoma-survey-cote-divoire-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Accelerate programme</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">The Accelerate trachoma elimination programme aims to support at least 15 countries to eliminate trachoma as a public health risk, and speed up progress in two others by 2027.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/ready-for-inclusive-sustainable-employment-and-entrepreneurship/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A woman wearing graduation attire speaks into a microphone while onstage.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/2307_Sightsavers-sharon-IT-bridge-academy-kenya-graduation-crop-175918-300x169.png\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/2307_Sightsavers-sharon-IT-bridge-academy-kenya-graduation-crop-175918-1024x575.png 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2025/11/2307_Sightsavers-sharon-IT-bridge-academy-kenya-graduation-crop-175918-300x169.png 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">RISE/E initiative</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">This initiative, Ready for Inclusive Sustainable Employment and Entrepreneurship, tackles inequality and promotes economic inclusion for young people with disabilities.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/wish-programme-phase-two/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A woman wearing a hijab writes on flipchart paper during a workshop. Two men are sitting on either side of her, watching on as she writes.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/2512_Sightsavers-WISH2-programme-workshop-senegal-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/2512_Sightsavers-WISH2-programme-workshop-senegal-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2026/02/2512_Sightsavers-WISH2-programme-workshop-senegal-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">WISH2 programme</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">The second phase of the Women’s Integrated Sexual Health (WISH2) programme aims to build inclusive and sustainable sexual and reproductive health systems in West and Central Africa.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__grid\">\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/school-health-integrated-programming/\" style=\"flex:2\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A girl wears optometry glasses during a vision test at school in Islamabad, Pakistan.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/2310_Sightsavers-SHIP-vision-test-islamabad-pakistan-184988-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/2310_Sightsavers-SHIP-vision-test-islamabad-pakistan-184988-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/2310_Sightsavers-SHIP-vision-test-islamabad-pakistan-184988-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Improving health and nutrition in schools</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">This programme, known as SHIP, checks schoolchildren for health problems and refers them for treatment.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/zambia-inclusive-education-project/\" style=\"flex:2\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"Ruth, a young student, smiles at the camera. She's wearing her green checked school shirt and carrying a backpack.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/2303_Sightsavers_Ruth-at-inclusive-school-in-Zambia-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/2303_Sightsavers_Ruth-at-inclusive-school-in-Zambia-1024x576.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2023/11/2303_Sightsavers_Ruth-at-inclusive-school-in-Zambia-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Tusambilile Chapamo</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">We’re improving educational opportunities for children and young people with disabilities in Zambia by increasing access to equitable and inclusive education.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__grid\">\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/disability-and-inclusion/health/inclusive-eye-health/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A female optometrist points to a row on a Snellen chart.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/2405_Sightsavers-amnaa-points-to-letter-on-snellen-chart-inspire-pakistan-190233-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/2405_Sightsavers-amnaa-points-to-letter-on-snellen-chart-inspire-pakistan-190233-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2025/08/2405_Sightsavers-amnaa-points-to-letter-on-snellen-chart-inspire-pakistan-190233-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Inclusive eye health</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">Sightsavers advocates for universal health coverage, so everyone, wherever they live, can access quality, affordable health care when they need it.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/digital-health/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A close-up of a mobile phone being used by a health worker to record data.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Sightsavers-digital-health-Nigeria-data-collection-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Sightsavers-digital-health-Nigeria-data-collection-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Sightsavers-digital-health-Nigeria-data-collection-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Using technology to fight disease</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">Sightsavers is pioneering new ways to use technology as part of programmes to tackle avoidable blindness.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/uganda-inclusive-education-project/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"Three students sit a desk in a classroom wearing school uniform. One of the children has a physical disability.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/2507_Sightsavers-babiyre-uganda-inclusive-education-hero-207890-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/2507_Sightsavers-babiyre-uganda-inclusive-education-hero-207890-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2026/01/2507_Sightsavers-babiyre-uganda-inclusive-education-hero-207890-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Uganda inclusive education project</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">Sightsavers is working with the Ugandan government to improve inclusive education across the country.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
  },
