    "html": "<div class=\"c-discover-more-2 o-module\">\n<div class=\"o-layout-container\">\n<h2 class=\"c-discover-more-2__title\">Recent programmes</h2>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__grid\">\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/sierra-leone-education-programme/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"Student Haja has faced challenges at school due to poor vision, which affected her attendance and performance.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/2411_Sightsavers_Head-girl-in-Sierra-Leone-secondary-school-Haja-Kakay-struggled-with-school-before-receiving-eye-treatment-cropped_CREDIT_Mariama-Margret-Sannoh-300x169.png\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/2411_Sightsavers_Head-girl-in-Sierra-Leone-secondary-school-Haja-Kakay-struggled-with-school-before-receiving-eye-treatment-cropped_CREDIT_Mariama-Margret-Sannoh-1024x575.png 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2025/01/2411_Sightsavers_Head-girl-in-Sierra-Leone-secondary-school-Haja-Kakay-struggled-with-school-before-receiving-eye-treatment-cropped_CREDIT_Mariama-Margret-Sannoh-300x169.png 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Sierra Leone education programme</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">The programme, which ended in 2026, aimed to make secondary secondary schools more inclusive and accessible for all students, especially girls and children with disabilities.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/inclusive-futures/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A woman wearing a head scarf smiles broadly while standing in a doorway.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2508_Hussaina-Inclusive-Futures-hero-crop-300x169.png\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2508_Hussaina-Inclusive-Futures-hero-crop-1024x575.png 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2508_Hussaina-Inclusive-Futures-hero-crop-300x169.png 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Inclusive Futures</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">This programme tested innovative ways to improve economic empowerment and inclusion for people with disabilities, enabling them to earn a living, access quality healthcare and get an education.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/wish-programme-phase-one/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"Dr Valentin guides two women during a workshop in Kinshasa.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/2211_Sightsavers-MSI-dr-valentin-kinshasa-drc-SRHR-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/2211_Sightsavers-MSI-dr-valentin-kinshasa-drc-SRHR-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2024/04/2211_Sightsavers-MSI-dr-valentin-kinshasa-drc-SRHR-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">WISH1 programme</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">The first phase of the Women’s Integrated Sexual Health (WISH1) programme aimed to increase access to sexual and reproductive health and rights services for women in West and Central Africa. It ran from 2018 to 2024.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__grid\">\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/dissect-project/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"Two men standing by a river stare at a black fly trap, which consists of a square piece of blue tarpaulin attached to a wooden frame. There are also tubes that lead into water containers.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Sightsavers-DISSECT-black-fly-trap-mobile-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Sightsavers-DISSECT-black-fly-trap-mobile-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Sightsavers-DISSECT-black-fly-trap-mobile-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">DISSECT project: putting people first in the elimination of onchocerciasis</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">This four-year research initiative explored new tools to help eliminate the parasitic infection river blindness.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/oem-project/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A close-up of a man's hand as he picks a fly from a leaf.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/Sightsavers-fly-catching-Uganda-close-up-2-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/Sightsavers-fly-catching-Uganda-close-up-2-1024x576.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2018/10/Sightsavers-fly-catching-Uganda-close-up-2-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Onchocerciasis elimination mapping project</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">We worked with our partners in Ghana and Nigeria to devise new ways to collect valuable data about the spread and transmission of river blindness.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/connecting-the-dots/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"Edith sat in a chair, wearing a black t-shirt, smiling.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/Edith-smiling-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/Edith-smiling-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2016/08/Edith-smiling-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Connecting the Dots</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">This employment programme provided vocational training courses for people with disabilities in western Uganda, helping to transform attitudes within the local community and create more inclusive workplaces.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__grid\">\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/commonwealth-fund/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A health worker holds a pot of pills and pours some out into his hands.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/2309_Sightsavers_Medication-to-treat-NTDs-new-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/2309_Sightsavers_Medication-to-treat-NTDs-new-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/2309_Sightsavers_Medication-to-treat-NTDs-new-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">The Commonwealth Fund</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">This two-year programme funded trachoma operations, treatment and improved hygiene and sanitation across 10 countries in the Commonwealth.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/super-school-of-5/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"The five cartoon superheroes from the campaign.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Sightsavers-superheroes-Super-School-of-5-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Sightsavers-superheroes-Super-School-of-5-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Sightsavers-superheroes-Super-School-of-5-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Super School of Five</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">This programme introduced superhero characters to schoolchildren in Kenya, Ethiopia, Zambia and Nigeria to encourage better hygiene, to help eliminate trachoma.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/ascend/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A round tablet sits in the palm of a hand.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Sightsavers-generic-hand-holding-tablet-300x169.png\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Sightsavers-generic-hand-holding-tablet-1024x575.png 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Sightsavers-generic-hand-holding-tablet-300x169.png 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Ascend: fighting disease in Africa</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">This programme was Sightsavers’ largest multiple neglected tropical disease programme to date. It launched in 2019 and closed in August 2021.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__grid\">\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/keepsight/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"An eye health worker wearing a mask and surgical gown checks a woman's eyes using optical equipment.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/2003_Sightsavers-eye-exam-at-Kalinga-Eye-Hospital-in-Odisha-India-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/2003_Sightsavers-eye-exam-at-Kalinga-Eye-Hospital-in-Odisha-India-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2021/11/2003_Sightsavers-eye-exam-at-Kalinga-Eye-Hospital-in-Odisha-India-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Keep Sight</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">To tackle glaucoma in India and Nigeria, Sightsavers worked with pharmaceutical company AbbVie and the International Agency for the Prevention of Blindness.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/seeing-is-believing/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A table with spectacles and eye testing equipment on top.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Sightsavers-eye-health-in-Dhaka-Bangladesh_credit-Reza-Shahriar-Rahman-300x169.png\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Sightsavers-eye-health-in-Dhaka-Bangladesh_credit-Reza-Shahriar-Rahman-1024x575.png 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Sightsavers-eye-health-in-Dhaka-Bangladesh_credit-Reza-Shahriar-Rahman-300x169.png 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Seeing is Believing</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">This 17-year-long project worked to treat avoidable blindness and improve local healthcare. It reached more than 34 million people living in Africa and Asia.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/right-to-health/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A tuk-tuk travels down a road in Bangladesh.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sightsavers-generic-eye-health-bangladesh-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sightsavers-generic-eye-health-bangladesh-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sightsavers-generic-eye-health-bangladesh-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">The Right to Health</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">This programme focused on restoring sight and making health services accessible for marginalised groups in Pakistan and Bangladesh.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__grid\">\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/safe-trachoma-control/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A close-up of a school student washing her hands using water running from a tap in a large water butt.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/2012_Sightsavers-Students-wash-hands-before-class-in-Littoral-region-Cameroon-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/2012_Sightsavers-Students-wash-hands-before-class-in-Littoral-region-Cameroon-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2021/12/2012_Sightsavers-Students-wash-hands-before-class-in-Littoral-region-Cameroon-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">SAFE: trachoma control</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">Sightsavers’ trachoma control programme, which came to an end in 2019, helped to protect more than 18 million people.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/united/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A health worker holds a pot of pills and pours some out into his hands.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/2309_Sightsavers_Medication-to-treat-NTDs-new-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/2309_Sightsavers_Medication-to-treat-NTDs-new-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/2309_Sightsavers_Medication-to-treat-NTDs-new-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">UNITED in Nigeria</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">This six-year UNITED programme, funded by UK aid, delivered more than 158 million treatments in Nigeria to tackle neglected tropical diseases.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/a-million-miracles/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"Winesi March and his wife embrace at the joy of his sight being restored.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Winesi-bandage-removal-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Winesi-bandage-removal-1024x576.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Winesi-bandage-removal-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">A Million Miracles</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">Thanks to your support, between 2014 and 2017 our fundraising campaign raised enough money to provide a million sight-saving cataract operations.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__grid\">\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/river-blindness-lf/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A picture of a brown river with trees hanging over it.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/River-Sanaga-Cameroon-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/River-Sanaga-Cameroon-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2017/08/River-Sanaga-Cameroon-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Reducing LF and river blindness</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">Our programme, which ran from 2016 to 2019, provided medication to protect people at risk of river blindness and lymphatic filariasis.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/catch/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"Dr Postan Phiri\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/1903_Sightsavers-dr-phiri-opthamologist-zambia-cataracts-148239-cropped-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/1903_Sightsavers-dr-phiri-opthamologist-zambia-cataracts-148239-cropped-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/1903_Sightsavers-dr-phiri-opthamologist-zambia-cataracts-148239-cropped-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Coordinated Approach to Community Health (CATCH)</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">We wanted to ensure that patients visiting our trachoma screening camps could also be treated for other eye conditions.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/digital-health/global-trachoma-mapping-project/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A girl's eyes are examined as part of the Global Trachoma Mapping Project in Nigeria.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Sightsavers-Global-Trachoma-Mapping-Project-NIgeria-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Sightsavers-Global-Trachoma-Mapping-Project-NIgeria-1024x576.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Sightsavers-Global-Trachoma-Mapping-Project-NIgeria-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">The Global Trachoma Mapping Project (GTMP)</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">The project gathered a wealth of valuable data about the world’s trachoma-endemic areas using smartphones.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__grid\">\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/inclusive-education-senegal/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"A teacher gives guidance to a young boy with albinism in a classroom in Senegal.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/2112_Sightsavers-inclusive-education-albinism-senegal-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/2112_Sightsavers-inclusive-education-albinism-senegal-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2023/10/2112_Sightsavers-inclusive-education-albinism-senegal-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Inclusive education in Senegal</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">This pilot project showed that children with and without disabilities can learn together.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/trachoma-initiative/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"Samantha, a nine-year-old girl, has her eye examined after an operation for advanced trachoma.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/2401_samantha-trachoma-screening-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/2401_samantha-trachoma-screening-1024x575.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2024/07/2401_samantha-trachoma-screening-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Trachoma Initiative</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">The five-year programme provided millions of sight-saving treatments to help eliminate trachoma in seven countries.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"c-discover-more-2__item\" href=\"/programmes/bhopal-inclusive-eye-health-project/\" style=\"flex:1\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__image c-tease-card__image\">\n<img alt=\"Art student putting finishing touches to the Inclusive Eye Health mural in Bhopal.\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Sightsavers-inclusive-eye-health-Bhopal-art-project-3-300x169.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Sightsavers-inclusive-eye-health-Bhopal-art-project-3-1024x576.jpg 2x, /wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Sightsavers-inclusive-eye-health-Bhopal-art-project-3-300x169.jpg 1x\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-content\">\n<div class=\"c-discover-more-2__title-link\">\n<!-- add acf flag to show/hide taxonomy tags -->\n<!-- end -->\n<h3 class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-header\">Bhopal inclusive eye health project</h3>\n</div>\n<p class=\"c-discover-more-2__card-description\">Sightsavers’ pilot project in India aimed to ensure that everyone can access eye health services.</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
  },
